      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA WIN COIN (2) hit the ground running last start and was never headed (18.44) at Richmond in Maiden over 320m. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. ZIPPING JAKARA (1) claimed maiden win two back then finished a 1.5 lengths third last start at The Gardens over 400m (23.28). Back to track where she won her maiden. Rates a leading chance again. MORE DRAMA (3) is a consistent runner who is having her first try here. Lines up here in winning form after scoring by 2.5 lengths from box two at The Gardens (23.03). The form out of her last race has been franked. Capable of going well again. STILTON SUPREME (8) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
